Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:05.80,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}Bahia, Brazil. 1887.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:10.60,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}One year before abolition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:14.70,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}An uncle you barely knew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.60,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}left you a small house by the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.60,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}The others laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:23.90,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}“It isn't worth the journey.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.20,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}You went.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:31.70,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}One night across the Bay of All Saints…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.20,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}…and at dawn, a village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:40.20,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}Bom Jesus dos Pobres.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.60,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}Fish the tides. Work the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:56.40,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}Meet the people. Learn the old tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.90,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}But here…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:04.80,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)}nobody walks the forest after dark.
